# Soul Search is its own app, deployed on its own cadence to Firebase
# Hosting, and served here under /soulsearch. The prefix is kept on both
# sides so one set of asset paths works in either place.
#
# Both rules proxy (200). A 301 from /soulsearch to /soulsearch/ loops,
# because Netlify normalises the trailing slash before matching and the
# rule then redirects to itself.
#
# These must stay ABOVE the catch-all, which would otherwise answer every
# /soulsearch request with this site's own index.html.
/soulsearch/*     https://soul-search-chat.web.app/soulsearch/:splat  200
/soulsearch       https://soul-search-chat.web.app/soulsearch/        200

/*    /index.html   200
